      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TRENTON'S MISS (1) was midfield throughout and finished there last time when 4th (25.97) at this track. Has placed several times at this track. Has ability and looks hard to stop. ARC FLASH (5) turned in a modest effort most recently when sixth at Bendigo over 425m behind Mr. Jones (24.42) in a Mix 6/7. Has never been out of the placings from two starts out of this box. Should be about the mark. MAXIMUM RUBY (7) got off the mark last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths at Warrnambool over 390m (22.64). Will break from a wide draw. Expected to feature again. CHEEKY STREAK (2) can play a role in the finish without surprising.",
